Error [E1260]: a sandbox's exported function has an unsupported signature
 Why: `pub fn is_even` isn't all-`Int` or all-`Float` across its parameters and return type
 Fix: every parameter and the return type must be all `Int` or all `Float` (v1 sandbox scope) — narrow the signature, or drop `pub` if this function isn't meant to be called across the sandbox boundary
